Subject: [PATCH] Report native Dolt clone transfer progress
Base: DoltLite master ffa0eafa93ab695f7863703a2cdaaa3fb7663374 with local patches 0001-0009

Intent:
- Preserve the existing dolt_clone SQL API and unobserved transfer path.
- Add an opt-in connection-scoped callback with Started, verified transfer and
  local reuse counters, Finalizing, and Completed events.
- During observed sync, count successful source payload transfers and read
  already-present chunks only from the local destination. Do not add source
  payload requests for local reuse.
- Preserve upstream clone refs rollback, durable install, and SQL session
  recovery behavior. Report Finalizing before refs installation and honor an
  interrupt there; report Completed only after final refs and working-tree
  state are sealed.
- Release the active callback guard on every post-attach return path. Lazy
  clones reject an active observer because they do not fetch the full graph.

--- a/doltlite.c
